  "_readme": "Settings for intel/market_intel.py. Edit categories here: label, colours and search terms. 'queries' are Google News searches (global, last 7 days). 'keywords' decide which category a story belongs to. 'gcc_queries' are extra Gulf-focused searches; 'gcc_min_posts' is how many GCC stories each edition tries to include. 'research' controls the weekly web research by Claude (viral watch, new vendors, category map); it only runs when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set.",
